mod_audio_fork
--------------
Source: drachtio-freeswitch-modules, commit 88e1465908a89bed5c95d336aa53a3899bb5abb5,
path modules/mod_audio_fork, retrieved from the Software Heritage archive
(swh:1:rev:88e1465908a89bed5c95d336aa53a3899bb5abb5, module directory
swh:1:dir:057788a171657382b245c329fd8aaa31202f5f76).
Modified: three local patches guard the uuid_audio_fork start command against missing or invalid
arguments, ignore playAudio messages without a string audioContentType, and keep the module loaded
for the life of the process (runtime unload corrupted the heap). Each change is
described in PROVENANCE.json ("patches"); the patch files live in the CRM repository under
telephony/third_party/mod_audio_fork/patches/.

